<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fraser says c/a deficit not growth impediment.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fraser says c/a deficit not growth impediment.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) retiring governor Bernie Fraser said on Thursday Australia's current account deficit was not an impediment to further economic growth.</p>
<p>He also said the deficit was not having an effect on interest rates.  </p>
<p>&quot;It's not constraining activity, it's not having an effect on the exchange rate or interest rates, so it's not an impediment,&quot; Fraser told a parliamentary committee.</p>
<p>-- Canberra bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
